<title>USA: Lane County, Ore., schools yield 5.50 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Lane County, Ore., schools yield 5.50 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said Monday it priced $9.64 million Lane County School District 1, Ore., general obligation bonds at a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>AMT: 9,640,000	DATE: 11/25/96		   CUSIP: 515282</p>
<p>ISSUER: Lane County School District 1		ST: OR</p>
